        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) The Company will endeavor to have payroll checks available for distribution on Thursday of each week unless unknown or unavoidable conditions prevent the Company from doing so. If there is a delay in delivery to a Job Location, every reasonable effort will be made to issue Field drafts or other means, to all Employees ordinarily by noon on Friday.",
